  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET Core Calendars package includes a rich set of date and time input controls: Calendar, DatePicker, DateRangePicker, DateTimePicker, and TimePicker. These controls offer features like globalization, localization, min/max date restrictions, disabled dates, multiple date selection, custom date rendering, and accessibility support. They are ideal for scheduling, booking, and form-based ASP.NET Core applications that require reliable date and time input handling.",
